{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:625f71a471265f2ff5f5ba2e633bee424cd8fa5b48969a24338a5467c197c2d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b:2_4_041_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b22c2e7e8eff7c9fde1a8ef16090ed28d999e1d780a38dea59b9e38af2c2c6d",
      "text": "……喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n因为还想再多聊聊，所以打了电话过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b:2_4_041_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209880df2fd16db1dca7fb5b538a7f134b0335a88dd1fc2896d1978bbc9db4f6",
      "text": "再次说一声，今天的演出辛苦了。\n我真的觉得超级开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b:2_4_041_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d9557c3c5990a064705080c92fb990b3131e2a881a6706cf7a0d7cc992b914",
      "text": "来看演出的大家似乎也都很尽兴，\n太令人高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b:2_4_041_01_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acef62eae2376a691c859aad89336f81af554964c48323eb9c4caea9ce1537dc",
      "text": "为了能让F-LAGS的三个人下次一起听到\n今天我听到的那些欢呼声，明天开始我也会继续加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_401_2_4_041_01_09_b:2_4_041_01_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07772867e6cb1f6a7dd545e820ed2a962e5c6bd9f383a03951bb02585ca4b139",
      "text": "能跟您聊上天真开心。诶嘿嘿。\n那么，再见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
